# LF everywhere, whatever core.autocrlf says: gofmt, Next and editors write LF,
# and a CRLF checkout then shows unchanged files as modified.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.png   binary
*.ico   binary
*.syso  binary
# Translation files must round-trip byte for byte.
*.xlf   -text
*.xliff -text
testdata/** -text
